    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d349">

                <pb facs="0473" n="405" xml:id="pg405"/>

                <head>Mr. Seward to Mr. de Stoeckl</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <hi
                                rendition="#italic">Washington</hi>,</placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1867-08-13"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >August</hi> 13, 1867</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to inform you that
                    Brigadier General Lo vell H. Rousseau has been appointed by the President the
                    commissioner on the part of the United States to receive from the commissioner
                    appointed on behalf of his Majesty the Emperor of all the Russias the territory
                    ceded to the United States by the treaty of the 30th of March last. A copy of
                    the instructions which have been given to General Rousseau for his guidance in
                    executing that trust is herewith communicated for your information and that of
                    your government.</p>
                <p>I avail myself of this occasion, sir, to offer to you a renewed assurance of my
                    most distinguished consideration.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>WILLIAM H. SEWARD.</signed>
                </closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>Mr. <hi rendition="#small-caps">Edward de Stoeckl</hi>, <hi
                            rendition="#italic">&amp;c., &amp;c., &amp;c.</hi></p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
